[1mA stale-[38;5;10m.so[0m trap nearly produced a false bug report.[22m After a mutation experiment I restored [38;5;10msrc/lib.rs[0m with [38;5;10mcp[0m; cargo's mtime fingerprinting treated the same-second edit as up to date and kept testing the [3mmutant[23m. I only caught it by disassembling the [38;5;10m.so[0m and recognizing the mutation in the codegen. [38;5;10mrun_verification.sh[0m and [38;5;10mmutation_sweep.sh[0m now delete/[38;5;10mtouch[0m artifacts before every build.[0m[0m
